Subject: [PATCH] Venetium 0059: a built-in ad and tracker blocker

From Venetium (github.com/hamed7ir/venetium), patches/0059-builtin-ad-blocker.patch, without its installer list (chrome/installer/mini_installer/chrome.release): subresource_filter with an all-sites preset and the list from venetium_filters next to the executable.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
